    "detailed_description": "The Guardian Stone is a third person Action Tower Defense Game with Rpg elements and multiplayer. Set in the fantasy world of Elrone, You play as a hero protecting the realm from the forces of evil.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663860/extras/d96f1cdf8f05a77adf596b2149f470fd.poster.avif?t=1669008185\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663860/extras/d96f1cdf8f05a77adf596b2149f470fd.webm?t=1669008185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663860/extras/d96f1cdf8f05a77adf596b2149f470fd.mp4?t=1669008185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663860/extras/6404ea1287c0fa719791ea131ffcfa1d.poster.avif?t=1669008185\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663860/extras/6404ea1287c0fa719791ea131ffcfa1d.webm?t=1669008185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663860/extras/6404ea1287c0fa719791ea131ffcfa1d.mp4?t=1669008185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Play the entire game Solo or with up to 3 friends online.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663860/extras/8cdd36c7c164f26a2bddcd783753b3f7.poster.avif?t=1669008185\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663860/extras/8cdd36c7c164f26a2bddcd783753b3f7.webm?t=1669008185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663860/extras/8cdd36c7c164f26a2bddcd783753b3f7.mp4?t=1669008185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Test your Strategy and skills inside the arena, and check out the player vs player mode where one player takes control of the map and spawns waves of enemy's, with the ability to posses and take direct control of any character they spawn.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663860/extras/801254039614fa7cbb7b9f408dc0a807.poster.avif?t=1669008185\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663860/extras/801254039614fa7cbb7b9f408dc0a807.webm?t=1669008185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663860/extras/801254039614fa7cbb7b9f408dc0a807.mp4?t=1669008185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Featuring a leveling system with unlockable skills, a talent tree and weapon abilities.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663860/extras/0a5f99023c0a29f9a26bc68ddc6278b7.poster.avif?t=1669008185\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663860/extras/0a5f99023c0a29f9a26bc68ddc6278b7.webm?t=1669008185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663860/extras/0a5f99023c0a29f9a26bc68ddc6278b7.mp4?t=1669008185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Find Pets and companions with special abilities to help you get through the more challenging levels.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663860/extras/3366b72f22f6111bf6aa526df5ab3a4e.poster.avif?t=1669008185\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663860/extras/3366b72f22f6111bf6aa526df5ab3a4e.webm?t=1669008185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663860/extras/3366b72f22f6111bf6aa526df5ab3a4e.mp4?t=1669008185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663860/extras/cc2f993bac52d0cecf119abeb057bf8f.avif?t=1669008185\" /></div><br>Join the Guardian Stone Discord to keep up with the development!<br>",
    "about_the_game": "The Guardian Stone is a third person Action Tower Defense Game with Rpg elements and multiplayer. Set in the fantasy world of Elrone, You play as a hero protecting the realm from the forces of evil.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663860/extras/d96f1cdf8f05a77adf596b2149f470fd.poster.avif?t=1669008185\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663860/extras/d96f1cdf8f05a77adf596b2149f470fd.webm?t=1669008185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663860/extras/d96f1cdf8f05a77adf596b2149f470fd.mp4?t=1669008185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663860/extras/6404ea1287c0fa719791ea131ffcfa1d.poster.avif?t=1669008185\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663860/extras/6404ea1287c0fa719791ea131ffcfa1d.webm?t=1669008185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663860/extras/6404ea1287c0fa719791ea131ffcfa1d.mp4?t=1669008185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Play the entire game Solo or with up to 3 friends online.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663860/extras/8cdd36c7c164f26a2bddcd783753b3f7.poster.avif?t=1669008185\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663860/extras/8cdd36c7c164f26a2bddcd783753b3f7.webm?t=1669008185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663860/extras/8cdd36c7c164f26a2bddcd783753b3f7.mp4?t=1669008185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Test your Strategy and skills inside the arena, and check out the player vs player mode where one player takes control of the map and spawns waves of enemy's, with the ability to posses and take direct control of any character they spawn.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663860/extras/801254039614fa7cbb7b9f408dc0a807.poster.avif?t=1669008185\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663860/extras/801254039614fa7cbb7b9f408dc0a807.webm?t=1669008185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663860/extras/801254039614fa7cbb7b9f408dc0a807.mp4?t=1669008185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Featuring a leveling system with unlockable skills, a talent tree and weapon abilities.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663860/extras/0a5f99023c0a29f9a26bc68ddc6278b7.poster.avif?t=1669008185\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663860/extras/0a5f99023c0a29f9a26bc68ddc6278b7.webm?t=1669008185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663860/extras/0a5f99023c0a29f9a26bc68ddc6278b7.mp4?t=1669008185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Find Pets and companions with special abilities to help you get through the more challenging levels.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663860/extras/3366b72f22f6111bf6aa526df5ab3a4e.poster.avif?t=1669008185\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663860/extras/3366b72f22f6111bf6aa526df5ab3a4e.webm?t=1669008185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663860/extras/3366b72f22f6111bf6aa526df5ab3a4e.mp4?t=1669008185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663860/extras/cc2f993bac52d0cecf119abeb057bf8f.avif?t=1669008185\" /></div><br>Join the Guardian Stone Discord to keep up with the development!<br>",
